===Etymology===
From {{etyl|it|en}} {{m|it|passacaglia}}, from {{etyl|es|en}} {{m|es|pasear||to walk}} + {{m|es|calle||street}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{label|en|music}} A form of historical [[Spanish]] or [[Italian]] dance characterised by a serious nature, [[triple metre]], and use of a [[ground bass]].
# {{label|en|music}} Any piece of [[classical music]] with similar characteristics.

